internal/home/canonical_path.go	joinContained	1	rel == ".." || strings.HasPrefix(rel, ".."+string(filepath.Separator))	BEO-69: unreachable post-check. The loop above rejects every "", "." and ".." component of the raw key before Clean/Join run, so no accepted key can produce a rel that escapes. Both branches return the identical ErrKeyEscapes, so a message-asserting test would go green without entering this one (the BEO-87 shape). Probed: every escaping key is refused by the component loop.
internal/home/canonical_path.go	privateDir	1	!info.IsDir()	BEO-69: a post-check against a race, not an unreachable branch. On the single-threaded path os.MkdirAll returns ENOTDIR first for a path that exists as a file or a symlink to one, so Stat never observes a non-directory (probed with both shapes, plus 7 by review). But MkdirAll (canonical_path.go:79) and Stat are two syscalls: another writer that replaces the path between them lands here. That TOCTOU window is why there is no deterministic test, not that the branch cannot be entered.
internal/home/canonical_path.go	verifyNoFollow	1	parent == cur	BEO-69: unreachable GIVEN that target is always absolute, which both callers (canonical.go:181, canonical_journal.go:150) satisfy: they derive it from h.RootFor over h.root = id.CanonicalRoot, which HomeIdentity.validate pins to canonicalRoot(filepath.Abs(root)). Under that premise the walk stops at the deepest existing ancestor and "/" always exists, so filepath.Dir never reaches a fixed point (probed with absolute, relative, nonexistent and empty targets). A RELATIVE target breaks the premise: the walk stops at ".", filepath.Dir(".") == ".", and the branch is entered once the cwd is removed. A future caller passing a relative path invalidates this waiver.
internal/home/mailbox_receiver.go	ReadHomeIdentity	1	!info.IsDir()	BEO-69: post-check against a race: a stable regular-file path fails earlier with ENOTDIR while reading the marker, so this branch requires another writer to replace the home between os.ReadFile and os.Stat; no deterministic test can force that TOCTOU window. Premise pinned by TestReadHomeIdentityRefusesUnusableMarkers/a_markerless_home_that_is_not_a_directory.
